        "content": "\n**Location:** Workspace pages with search\n\n**Fix:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { useDeferredValue } from 'react';\n\nfunction WorkspacePage() {\n  const [searchInput, setSearchInput] = useState(\"\");\n  const deferredSearch = useDeferredValue(searchInput);\n  \n  const filtered = useMemo(() => \n    data.filter(item => \n      item.name.toLowerCase().includes(deferredSearch.toLowerCase())\n    ),\n    [data, deferredSearch] // Uses deferred value\n  );\n\n  return (\n    <Input\n      value={searchInput} // Controlled with immediate value\n      onChange={(e) => setSearchInput(e.target.value)}\n      placeholder=\"Search...\"\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Impact:** 🟢 **Low** - Smoother typing experience\n\n---\n\n",
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "title": "Summary Table",
        "content": "| Issue | Severity | Impact | Effort | Priority |\n|-------|----------|--------|--------|----------|\n| Unbounded Set growth | 🔴 Critical | Memory leak | Low | **P0** |\n| State updates in loops | 🔴 Critical | N renders | Low | **P0** |\n| Missing timeout cleanup | 🔴 Critical | Stale state | Low | **P0** |\n| Motion variants recreation | 🟡 Medium | Allocations | Low | P1 |\n| Missing React.memo | 🟡 Medium | Re-renders | Medium | P1 |\n| Redundant parsing | 🟡 Medium | O(n) waste | Low | P1 |\n| Socket listener leak | 🟡 Medium | Duplicates | Low | P2 |\n| No request cache | 🟢 Nice | Server load | Medium | P3 |\n| No virtualization | 🟢 Nice | Large lists | High | P3 |\n| No search debounce | 🟢 Nice | Input lag | Low | P3 |\n\n**Recommended order:** Fix all 🔴 Critical issues first (P0), then 🟡 Medium (P1-P2), then 🟢 Nice-to-have (P3).",
        "level": 2
      }
    ],
